/about                /about/             301
/strategies           /strategies/        301
/european-approach    /european-approach/ 301
/governance           /governance/        301
/investors            /investors/         301
/blog                 /blog/              301

# Blog articles (preserve trailing slash)
/blog/sustainable-investing    /blog/sustainable-investing/    301
/blog/european-approach       /blog/european-approach/        301
/blog/governance-matters      /blog/governance-matters/       301

